// Card 的具名分组视觉由 UIX 唯一拥有；Rust 内核负责子树生命周期、交互、布局与绘制。
<Visual
  name="CARD_DEFAULTS_VISUAL"
  type="CardDefaultsVisual"
  width={200.0}
  height={120.0}
  padding={16.0}
  bordered={true}
  elevation={1}
  maxElevation={3}
  bodyGap={0.0}
/>

<Visual
  name="CARD_TITLE_VISUAL"
  type="CardTitleVisual"
  blockHeight={56.0}
  textHeight={44.0}
  separatorOffset={48.0}
  separatorThickness={1.0}
  fontSize={15.0}
  minFontSize={11.0}
  verticalInset={2.0}
/>

<Visual
  name="CARD_ACTION_VISUAL"
  type="CardActionVisual"
  height={40.0}
  fontSize={13.0}
  minFontSize={10.0}
  horizontalInset={6.0}
  verticalInset={2.0}
  dividerInset={8.0}
  dividerThickness={1.0}
  focusInset={1.0}
  focusStrokeWidth={2.0}
  centerRatio={0.5}
/>

<Visual
  name="CARD_SURFACE_VISUAL"
  type="CardSurfaceVisual"
  borderWidth={1.0}
  hoverLighten={0.05}
  radiusLimitRatio={0.5}
  accentMinElevation={2}
  accentHorizontalInset={24.0}
  accentHeight={3.0}
  accentRadiusRatio={0.5}
  shadowDirectionalYScale={1.5}
  shadowAmbientXScale={0.3}
  shadowAmbientYScale={0.6}
  shadowGlowOffsetX={0.0}
  shadowGlowOffsetY={0.0}
/>

<Visual
  name="CARD_LOW_ELEVATION_VISUAL"
  type="CardElevationVisual"
  directionalScale={0.8}
  ambientScale={1.2}
  glowScale={1.6}
  alphaBoost={1.1}
  dirtyExpand={50.0}
/>

<Visual
  name="CARD_MEDIUM_ELEVATION_VISUAL"
  type="CardElevationVisual"
  directionalScale={1.0}
  ambientScale={1.6}
  glowScale={2.2}
  alphaBoost={1.0}
  dirtyExpand={70.0}
/>

<Visual
  name="CARD_HIGH_ELEVATION_VISUAL"
  type="CardElevationVisual"
  directionalScale={1.2}
  ambientScale={2.2}
  glowScale={3.0}
  alphaBoost={0.9}
  dirtyExpand={95.0}
/>

<Visual
  name="CARD_PALETTE_VISUAL"
  type="CardPaletteVisual"
  background={card_background()}
  elevatedBackground={card_elevated_background()}
  primary={card_primary()}
  border={card_border()}
  text={card_text()}
  actionHover={card_action_hover()}
/>

<Visual
  name="CARD_VISUAL"
  type="CardVisual"
  defaults={CARD_DEFAULTS_VISUAL}
  title={CARD_TITLE_VISUAL}
  action={CARD_ACTION_VISUAL}
  surface={CARD_SURFACE_VISUAL}
  elevations={[
    CARD_LOW_ELEVATION_VISUAL,
    CARD_MEDIUM_ELEVATION_VISUAL,
    CARD_HIGH_ELEVATION_VISUAL
  ]}
  radius={card_large_radius()}
  shadow={card_default_shadow()}
  palette={CARD_PALETTE_VISUAL}
/>

<KernelView value={build_card_view(kernel, children, CARD_VISUAL_REF)} />
